	Two small omissions:

UNICORN HORNS:
	Applying a unicorn horn has a chance of raising a stat that has been
lowered (by poison or a potion of sickness) by one. This is accompanied by
the message, "This makes you feel good." Applying the horn enough times can
restore the stat to normal.

POTIONS:
	A cursed potion of enlightenment will give the message "You have
an uneasy feeling..." and provide no other information.

